_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_6","text":"but Neon certainly seemed happy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_7","text":"She hollered, \"Neon: Impact!\" and then took off running.","jump":"d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_11","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_8","text":"It seems she really enjoys looking for shells, hehe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_9","text":"In fact, she ran off without putting on her swim ring...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mary_s","key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_10","text":"Actually, I should have Pepper go find her and give that to her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":"_0"},{"id":"d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_11","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Counseling:d_counseling_mary_baygoddess_11_11","text":"Mary and I spend some time together, guessing how long Neon will be digging for shells.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"none","bgArt":"none","image":null,"bgm":null,